  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_5605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El barrio del Tossalet, en Onda, ha festejado la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado a su patr&oacute;n, San Bartolom&eacute;, con procesi&oacute;n y misa en la iglesia que lleva su nombre, en Monteblanco. Al volver al barrio se han soltado palomas blancas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5542.jpg\" alt=\"img_5542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5543.jpg\" alt=\"img_5543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5544.jpg\" alt=\"img_5544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5545.jpg\" alt=\"img_5545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5546.jpg\" alt=\"img_5546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5547.jpg\" alt=\"img_5547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5548.jpg\" alt=\"img_5548\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5549.jpg\" alt=\"img_5549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processosantbartomeutossalet13/img_5550.jpg\" alt=\"img_5550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto